// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in real values.
//
// CRITICAL: Use the Supabase **anon** (public) key only — NEVER the service_role key.
// The service_role key bypasses Row Level Security and must never ship in the iOS app.
// If a service_role key was ever committed, rotate it immediately in the Supabase dashboard.
//
// NOTE: .xcconfig files treat "//" as a comment delimiter anywhere on the line, which
// truncates URLs like "https://...". Escape it as "https:/$()/..." — the empty "$()"
// macro reference breaks up the "//" without changing the expanded value.
//
// SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/your-project.supabase.co
// SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = your-anon-public-key
// GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID = your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
